{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"92024c5570e90bb8e61a58d2ea08b8a43bc79493da9a233a591137c645c521c0","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","completeTranslationApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/complete.json","simpleCompleteTranslationApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/complete.simple.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"bbecf229516d3b6345585089028f6cc19b2191672ab34af97003ad4df731f0cf","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","firstChapterReference":{"translationId":"pan_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":1},"lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","lastChapterReference":{"translationId":"pan_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":150},"totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਸਹਾਇਤਾ ਦੇ ਲਈ ਸਵੇਰ ਦੀ ਪ੍ਰਾਰਥਨਾ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਦਾਊਦ ਦਾ ਭਜਨ। ਜਦੋਂ ਉਹ ਆਪਣੇ ਪੁੱਤਰ ਅਬਸ਼ਾਲੋਮ ਦੇ ਅੱਗੋਂ ਭੱਜਦਾ ਸੀ।"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਹੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਮੇਰੇ ਵਿਰੋਧੀ ਕਿੰਨੇ ਹੀ ਵੱਧ ਗਏ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੇਰੇ ਵਿਰੁੱਧ ਬਹੁਤ ਉੱਠ ਖੜੇ ਹੋਏ ਹਨ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"ਬਹੁਤੇ ਮੇਰੀ ਜਾਨ ਦੇ ਲਈ ਆਖਦੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਕਿ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਵੱਲੋਂ ਉਸ ਦੀ ਮਦਦ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ l ਸਲਹ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"ਪਰ ਹੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਤੂੰ ਮੇਰੇ ਦੁਆਲੇ ਢਾਲ਼ ਹੈਂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੇਰੀ ਮਹਿਮਾ ਅਤੇ ਮੇਰੇ ਸਿਰ ਦਾ ਉਠਾਉਣ ਵਾਲਾ ਹੈਂ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"ਮੈਂ ਆਪਣੀ ਆਵਾਜ਼ ਨਾਲ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਨੂੰ ਪੁਕਾਰਦਾ ਹਾਂ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਆਪਣੇ ਪਵਿੱਤਰ ਪਰਬਤ ਤੋਂ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਉੱਤਰ ਦਿੰਦਾ ਹੈ। ਸਲਹ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"ਮੈਂ ਲੰਮਾ ਪੈ ਗਿਆ ਅਤੇ ਸੌਂ ਗਿਆ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਮੈਂ ਜਾਗ ਉੱਠਿਆ, ਕਿਉਂਕਿ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਸੰਭਾਲਦਾ ਹੈ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"ਮੈਂ ਉਹਨਾਂ ਦਸ ਹਜ਼ਾਰਾਂ ਤੋਂ ਨਹੀਂ ਡਰਾਂਗਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੇ ਆਲੇ-ਦੁਆਲੇ ਮੇਰੇ ਵਿਰੁੱਧ ਘੇਰਾ ਪਾ ਲਿਆ ਹੈ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ਹੇ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ, ਉੱਠ! ਮੇਰੇ ਪਰਮੇਸ਼ੁਰ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਬਚਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੂੰ ਤਾਂ ਮੇਰੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਵੈਰੀਆਂ ਦੇ ਜਬਾੜਿਆਂ ਉੱਤੇ ਮਾਰਿਆ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਦੁਸ਼ਟਾਂ ਦੇ ਦੰਦ ਭੰਨ ਸੁੱਟੇ ਹਨ।","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"ਬਚਾਓ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਵੱਲੋਂ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਤੇਰੀ ਬਰਕਤ ਤੇਰੀ ਪਰਜਾ ਉੱਤੇ ਹੋਵੇ। ਸਲਹ।","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/3.json","thisChapterReference":{"translationId":"pan_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":3},"thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/4.json","nextChapterReference":{"translationId":"pan_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":4},"nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/2.json","previousChapterReference":{"translationId":"pan_irv","book":"PSA","chapter":2},"previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"thisChapterAudioTimings":{},"nextChapterAudioTimings":{},"previousChapterAudioTimings":{},"numberOfVerses":8,"simpleChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/3.simple.json"}